#. type: Content of: <messages><msg>
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:1 messages/po4a/en.xml:443
#, no-wrap
msgid "Dream"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title #
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Dream Mechanism"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "> Nightly creative narratives generated after light sleep; not factual memory.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <messages><msg>
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:9 docs/concepts/sleep.md:9
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:10 messages/po4a/en.xml:592
#: messages/po4a/en.xml:599
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:12
msgid ""
"Dreaming is the digital life's **imaginative** counterpart to memory "
"consolidation. It does not extract facts or update semantic inventory—it "
"produces a surreal, first-person narrative from the day's emotional tone and "
"random episodic fragments."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <messages><msg>
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:13 messages/po4a/en.xml:447
#, no-wrap
msgid "Trigger"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:20
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Condition                                                            | Result                     |\n"
"| -------------------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------- |\n"
"| No limbic memory with `intensity > 0.5` in the day's creation window | Skip (`no_strong_emotion`) |\n"
"| Dream already exists for that day                                    | Skip (`already_dreamed`)   |\n"
"| At least one strong limbic anchor produced that day                  | Generate dream             |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:22
msgid ""
"Trigger is **purely emotion-driven** (no random dice). Session activity is "
"**not** required; episodic fragments may be empty."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "Input"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:27
msgid ""
"**Emotional tone** — top 3 `limbic_memory` rows whose `created_at` falls in "
"`[conversation day 00:00 CST, next day 06:00 CST)` (covers daytime writes "
"and ~02:00 light-sleep extraction), where `intensity > 0.5`, ordered by "
"intensity descending."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:27
msgid ""
"**Episodic fragments** — random sample of user/assistant messages from the "
"day's sessions (conversation archive), capped ~4k chars; omitted when no "
"sessions were updated that day."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:29
msgid "Light sleep stage 2 must complete first so limbic anchors exist."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <messages><msg>
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:30 messages/po4a/en.xml:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Output"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:35
msgid ""
"Persisted in PG table `dream_memory` (one row per CST calendar day, unique "
"`dream_day`)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:35
msgid "Append-only; content is not updated after creation."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:35
msgid ""
"Does **not** create fridge magnets or notification inbox entries (see "
"[`fridge-magnet.md`](fridge-magnet.md), [`notifications.md`]"
"(notifications.md))."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:36 docs/concepts/sleep.md:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Orchestration"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:39
msgid "Sleep-cycle DAG node `dream`:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (text)
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:40
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"light-sleep\n"
"  ├─► deep-sleep ──► memory-ref-sync\n"
"  ├─► dream        (parallel with deep-sleep / self-layer-refresh)\n"
"  └─► self-layer-refresh\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:48
msgid ""
"LLM call uses `PROFILE_REFLECT` with elevated temperature (~1.1), **no "
"tools**, single completion."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:49
#, no-wrap
msgid "Tools & UI"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:55
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Surface                        | Purpose              |\n"
"| ------------------------------ | -------------------- |\n"
"| `dream_read` tool              | Read stored dream    |\n"
"| Admin `/admin/dashboard/dream` | Browse dream history |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:56
#, no-wrap
msgid "Design Notes"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:61
msgid "Dreams are **not** injected into system prompt or resident memory."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:61
msgid "Accuracy is explicitly **not** a goal; association and metaphor are."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:61
msgid "Dreams persist in PG regardless of Redis availability."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/dream.md:62
msgid "See also: [`sleep.md`](sleep.md), [`memory.md`](memory.md)."
msgstr ""
